msgid "Material, Qualitäten und Einsatzbereiche"
msgstr "Materials, qualities and application areas"

#: products/templates/products/includes/general_advice_sawblades.html:8
msgid ""
"Unser Streben nach perfekter Sägequalität beginnt schon bei der Auswahl "
"unseres Vormaterials, denn dies ist die Ausgangsbasis für unsere "
"Spitzenprodukte – nichts geht durch unsere Eingangskontrolle, das nicht die "
"Note „Sehr gut“ verdient."
msgstr ""
"Our pursuit of the perfect sawing quality already begins with the selection "
"of our starting materials, as these form the starting point for our top of "
"the line products – materials that are not classified as \"very good\" do not"
" pass our incoming goods inspection."

#: products/templates/products/includes/general_advice_sawblades.html:11
msgid ""
"Erstklassiges Rohmaterial ist bei GUHEMA die Basis für präzises, schnelles "
"und wirtschaftliches Sägen mit"
msgstr ""
"At GUHEMA, first-rate raw materials form the basis for a precise, quick and "
"economic sawing process with"

#: products/templates/products/includes/general_advice_sawblades.html:14
msgid "hohen Stand- und kurzen Schnittzeiten"
msgstr "long downtimes and short cutting times"

#: products/templates/products/includes/general_advice_sawblades.html:15
msgid "langer Lebensdauer"
msgstr "a long tool life"

#: products/templates/products/includes/general_advice_sawblades.html:16
msgid "optimaler Schonung Ihrer Sägemaschine"
msgstr "optimal protection for your sawing machine"

#: products/templates/products/includes/general_advice_sawblades.html:19
msgid ""
"Für die unterschiedlichsten Einsatzbereiche führen wir die passenden "
"Qualitäten"
msgstr "We offer matching qualities for various application areas"

