#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:485
#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:498
msgid "Seitlicher Fasenanschliff"
msgstr "Alternating cross-grinding"

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:488
msgid ""
"Nutzen Sie Ihren Vorteil durch unseren seitlichen Fasenanschliff. Sie "
"erhalten sauberste Schnittergebnisse. Vorzeitiges Ausbrechen der Zähne wird "
"durch den Fasenanschliff verhindert und wegen der leichten Spanabrollung "
"ergibt sich eine geringere Belastung von Blatt und Maschine &#8594; "
"Metallsägeblatt und Maschine leben länger."
msgstr ""
"Use your advantage with our lateral ground-in rake you will get the cleanest "
"cutting results. Premature teeth breaking is prevented by the ground-in rake "
"and a lower burdening of sawblade and machine results from the chip disposal "
"&#8594; both metal hacksaw blades and machine live longer."

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:494
msgid ""
"Den seitlichen Fasenanschliff fertigen wir bis 6 ZpZ auf Nachfrage gerne für "
"Sie. Sprechen Sie uns an!"
msgstr ""
"We will gladly produce the lateral ground-in rake up to 6 TPI for you upon "
"request. Contact us!"

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:503
msgid "Sie haben Probleme beim Sägen? – Wir haben die Antworten!"
msgstr "Are you having trouble sawing? – We've got the answers!"

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:507
msgid "Zahnbruch?"
msgstr "Teeth breaking?"

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:508
#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:517
#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:531
#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:543
msgid "Mögliche Ursachen:"
msgstr "Possible causes:"

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:510
msgid ""
"Zu niedrige Zähnezahl gewählt. Mindestens 3 Zähne sollten gleichzeitig im "
"Eingriff sein, auch bei Rohren und Profilen."
msgstr ""
"Too low number of teeth selected. At least three teeth should be engaged "
"simultaneously; this also applies to tubes and profiles."

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:511
msgid "Über Eck angesägt."
msgstr " You started sawing on a corner."

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:512
msgid "Falsche Einspannung des Werkstücks."
msgstr "Workpiece has been clamped incorrectly."

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:516
msgid "Blattbruch?"
msgstr "Blade breaking?"

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:519
msgid "Schnittkanal wurde zusammengedrückt und blockierte das Sägeblatt."
msgstr "The cutting channel has been pressed together and blocks the sawblade."

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:520
#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:545
msgid "Falsche Blattspannung."
msgstr "Incorrect blade tension."

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:521
msgid "Zu grobe Verzahnung für das Werkstück gewählt."
msgstr "Selected toothing is too coarse for the workpiece."

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:522
#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:547
msgid "Zu hoher Schnittdruck."
msgstr "Cutting pressure too high."

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:523
#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:548
msgid "Verschlissene Führungslager in der Maschine."
msgstr "Worn pilot bearings in the machine."

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:530
msgid "Vorzeitiges Abstumpfen der Zähne?"
msgstr "Premature dulling of the teeth?"

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:533
msgid "Zu feine Verzahnung gewählt."
msgstr "Selected toothing is too fine"

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:534
msgid "Zu hohe Schnittgeschwindigkeit für das Werkstück gewählt."
msgstr "Selected cutting speed too high for the workpiece."

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:535
msgid ""
"Zu hoher Druck (erhöhte Zahnbelastung) oder zu niedriger Druck (Zähne "
"schleifen über das Werkstück, statt einen Span zu heben)."
msgstr ""
"Too high pressure (increased tooth load) or too low pressure (teeth grinding "
"on the workpiece instead of lifting a chip)."

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:536
msgid "Unzureichende/falsch ausgerichtete Sägeblattkühlung."
msgstr "Inadequate/misaligned sawblade cooling."

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:537
msgid "Falsche Sägeblattqualität gewählt."
msgstr "Incorrect sawblade grade selected."

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:538
msgid "Kein Sägeblattausheben im Rücklauf."
msgstr "No sawblade lifting during return travel."

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:542
msgid "Ungewollter Schnittverlauf?"
msgstr "Unwanted course of the sawblade?"

#: products/templates/products/maschinensageblatter/advices.html:546
